                "Hardware-in-loop LaF3 precipitator LF-3 at Lanfluor-Smeaton LS-HIL sings at 64 pps "
                "on the cathode puck, four times the 16 pps hush. Agitator draw is a legal 28 kW "
                "under the 44 kW trip, so a kW-first raise would dump 9 t/h slurry into a growling "
                "rake. Only a parked rake is legal; acoustic AE outranks the gearbox.",